            "t2ge0": "Calibration assuming t^2 >= 0 (with temperature fluctuations).",
            "disp": "Global calibration dispersion sigma_fit (dex, RMS of fit residuals).",
            "sigma_cal": "Standard deviation of the metallicity residuals relative to the Te-based abundances (dex); the recommended uncertainty measure (Sec. 4.1/4.4 of the reference).",
            "disp_coeff": "sigma(x) profile coefficients in np.polyval order (descending power), i.e. sigma(x) = polyval(disp_coeff, x). Note this is NOT the ascending order written in Eq. 3 of the manuscript -- see the package README for the discrepancy note.",
            "oh_min_oh_max": "Informational only: the 12+log(O/H) range spanned by the calibration sample for this branch/scenario, oh_min < oh_max. Not used by calibrate() -- NaN is decided purely from the index (line-ratio) validity range, xmin/xmax.",
            "turnover": "Informational only (double_valued): the 12+log(O/H) turnover value(s) separating the upper/lower branches. 'shared: true' means a single Direction-B fit reproduces both branches (R3, R3S2), so upper_OH and lower_OH are two estimates of the same physical point.",
            "excluded_interval_OH": "Informational only: |turnover.upper_OH - turnover.lower_OH|; 0.0 when shared=true. Distinct from the gap between the branches' own oh_min/oh_max windows.",
            "xmin_xmax": "Validity range in index (line-ratio) units, log scale."
        }
    },
